# Generated content and scenes.
# Both are produced from code by PRISM > 2. Seed Concept Graph and 3. Build Scene, and are
# regenerated from scratch every time. Committing them would invite hand-edits that the next
# generate silently discards.
Assets/Prism/Content/
Assets/Prism/Content.meta
Assets/Prism/Scenes/Prism.unity
Assets/Prism/Scenes/Prism.unity.meta

# XR settings assets are generated by PrismConfigure
